    "classIdentifier": "cosmic_linguist",
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"6413\" data-end=\"6432\">🟦 Syntax Warden</h2><blockquote data-start=\"6434\" data-end=\"6454\"><p data-start=\"6436\" data-end=\"6454\"><em data-start=\"6436\" data-end=\"6454\">“No exceptions.”</em></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"6456\" data-end=\"6502\">Syntax Wardens enforce the grammar of reality.</p><p data-start=\"6504\" data-end=\"6720\">They bind spells with clauses, establish hard rules, and punish repeated violations like syntax errors in an unforgiving language. Where others counter magic with force, Syntax Wardens counter it with <strong data-start=\"6705\" data-end=\"6719\">invalidity</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"6722\" data-end=\"6806\">Their wards don’t shimmer—they declare.<br data-start=\"6761\" data-end=\"6764\" />“No teleport.”<br data-start=\"6778\" data-end=\"6781\" />“No lies.”<br data-start=\"6791\" data-end=\"6794\" />“No escape.”</p><p data-start=\"6808\" data-end=\"6848\">And the universe, reluctantly, complies.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
